{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Jancer find his purpose, in this super-tight, music-based platformer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792720/extras/511c9f1d46e7fcaea798be1b751d09af.poster.avif?t=1772493977\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792720/extras/511c9f1d46e7fcaea798be1b751d09af.webm?t=1772493977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792720/extras/511c9f1d46e7fcaea798be1b751d09af.mp4?t=1772493977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music to your ears, eyes and hands!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the chiptune and EDM music, cute pixel art and adapt to the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792720/extras/3f36c7a2568a5313939c2435f6247ec5.poster.avif?t=1772493977\" width=640 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792720/extras/3f36c7a2568a5313939c2435f6247ec5.webm?t=1772493977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792720/extras/3f36c7a2568a5313939c2435f6247ec5.mp4?t=1772493977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handcrafted stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every note influences the world around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792720/extras/fe378cf4063c06d2735c8fcba12d8bef.poster.a